{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-87eeee", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「抗議」を一度だけ含む断片へ、抗議を名乗らない制動を響かせる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-74c830", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-c54dd1", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-bc7ed7", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "石碑の比喩から、来歴の欄という石へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-89dae1", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-08766a", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-025", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "証言の語から、証言を聞かない受入へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-ff9c13", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-08766a", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-dd90b5", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "黙殺の欄から、書かないと決めた欄へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-95378d", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-87eeee", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-9ce5e0", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "慰めから、悼みを効果にしない禁へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-8e3ef8", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-87eeee", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-c54dd1", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "抗議から、抗議を名乗らない制動へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-d39c30", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261025-87eeee", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-141a58", "type": "material"}, "note": "第24歌で父が遺体を請う場面に、第22歌の「言い終える前の死」で応じる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-bc50af", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3bdc7c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-888d33", "type": "material"}, "note": "条約が破られた第一巻の分析を、力の等しい者のあいだでだけ正しさが問題になる第五巻で読み直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-e7dc9b", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3f52f9", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-00b565", "type": "material"}, "note": "同じ年被爆の記録でも、夏の花は一人の散文、黒い雨は複数の手記の編集である。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-b7e795", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-415aec", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-916e3f", "type": "material"}, "note": "主語のない碑文に、名前のついた一個の器物を響かせる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-7e0d10", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-227ac3", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-028eb9", "type": "material"}, "note": "番号を縫い付けた服から、輪郭の定まらない灰色の地帯へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-755ae8", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-b177b0", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-b73939", "type": "material"}, "note": "写真を狩りと呼んだ初期の論から、「われわれ」を前提にできないという晩年の論へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-897820", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-464", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-RES-20261025-6fdbe6", "type": "material"}, "note": "六人の生存者の平らな記録と、画面越しの加害者の症状の研究を対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-9b4ff6", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-f923bd", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-RES-20261025-c0d4df", "type": "material"}, "note": "永遠平和の予備条項と、拘束力ある文書の不在を対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-1b9f83", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-fbc462", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261025-war", "type": "material"}, "note": "排出の監査（行き先のない排出）を、戦争の監査（地の文の戦争0回）で読み直す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-045087", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-abject", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261025-war", "type": "material"}, "note": "顔の語が自分の声で減る勾配と、戦争の語が自分の声に一度も出ない勾配を並べる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-441b99", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261024-face", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-25", "left": {"id": "MAT-TRC-20261025-war", "type": "material"}, "note": "署名の監査が先送りした「戦争・兵士」を、四度目に迎える。", "relation_id": "REL-20261025-2a9c25", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261024-d2fe71", "type": "material"}}
